{"id":"483e9000e55f64a9","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-theory.md","title":"GL Theory","display":"df-gl-theory — GL Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-theory","aliases":["89-df-gl-theory"],"display":"df-gl-theory — GL Theory","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-theory — GL Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL},T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL},T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{C}_{G\\!L}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{GL}\\cup T\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{C}_{G\\!L}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{GL}\\cup T\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的每个元素当作新增公理；因此对这些新增公理也允许必然化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{G\\!L}(T)\">\\(\\mathcal C_{G\\!L}(T)\\)</span> 是包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\cup T\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\cup T\\)</span> 且对 MP 与 Nec\n封闭的最小公式集。它是否一致需要另行假设或证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL},T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-gl-logic]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL},T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{C}_{G\\!L}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{GL}\\cup T\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_{G\\!L}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\cup T","display":false}],"bytes":1034,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-308","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-theory]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","d246470e97fec132","32c9990061b9749d"]}